      "Ultimate classes and ultimate class frequencies",
      "The classes and class frequencies of the highest order are called the ultimate classes and ultimate class frequencies. For example, for one attribute ultimate classes are A, a and ultimate frequencies are (A), (a). For two attributes, ultimate classes are AB, AB, aB, aß and ultimate classes frequencies are (AB), (AB), (B), (aß). If we are considering three attributes A, B, C, then ultimate classes are ABC, ABY, ABC, Aßy, aBC, aBy, aẞC, aßy and ultimate class. frequencies are (ABC), (ABY). (ABC), (ABY). (aBC). (aBy), (aBC), (aby) and so",
